    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Regional Analyses\"\nformat:\n  html:\n    fig-dpi: 200\neditor_options: \n  chunk_output_type: console\nwarnings: false\nexecute:\n  cache: false\n---\n\n::: {.callout-note collapse='false' title='Caution'}\nThe Sustainability Metrics project, as well as this site itself, are works in progress. All data and analyses shown here are preliminary. \n:::\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\n\n## Introduction {#sec-intro}\n\nThis group of pages will present a survey of secondary data at the regional/county level in the Northeast. Add more context here eventually.\n\n## Dimension Graphs\n\n\n\n### Economics\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nplots$econ <- get_dimension_ggraph(\n  framework_df = tree,\n  include_metrics = TRUE,\n  dimension_in = 'economics',\n  y_limits = c(-3.75, 3.25),\n  palette = \"scico::batlowW\"\n)\nplots$econ\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](county_intro_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-1-1.png){width=3000}\n:::\n:::\n\n\n### Environment\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nplots$env <- get_dimension_ggraph(\n  framework_df = tree,\n  include_metrics = TRUE,\n  dimension_in = 'environment',\n  y_limits = c(-4.5, 3.25),\n  palette = \"scico::batlowW\"\n)\nplots$env\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](county_intro_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-2-1.png){width=2000}\n:::\n:::\n\n\n### Health\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nplots$health <- get_dimension_ggraph(\n  framework_df = tree,\n  include_metrics = TRUE,\n  dimension_in = 'health',\n  y_limits = c(-4.5, 3.25),\n  palette = \"scico::batlowW\"\n)\nplots$health\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](county_intro_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-3-1.png){width=2000}\n:::\n:::\n\n\n### Production\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nplots$prod <- get_dimension_ggraph(\n  framework_df = tree,\n  include_metrics = TRUE,\n  dimension_in = 'production',\n  y_limits = c(-4.5, 3.25),\n  palette = \"scico::batlowW\"\n)\nplots$prod\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](county_intro_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-4-1.png){width=2400}\n:::\n:::\n\n\n### Social\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nplots$social <- get_dimension_ggraph(\n  framework_df = tree,\n  include_metrics = TRUE,\n  dimension_in = 'social',\n  y_limits = c(-3, 3.25),\n  palette = \"scico::batlowW\"\n)\nplots$social\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](county_intro_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-5-1.png){width=2600}\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## TEMP\n\n\n\n\n\n## Dimension Table\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\ndata_paper_tree %>% \n  mutate(metric = case_when(\n    str_detect(metric, 'NONE') ~ NA,\n    .default = metric\n  )) %>% \n  arrange(dimension, index, indicator, metric) %>% \n  get_reactable()\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"reactable html-widget html-fill-item\" id=\"htmlwidget-493b5c1982b565e945fc\" style=\"width:auto;height:auto;\"></div>\n<script type=\"application/json\" data-for=\"htmlwidget-493b5c1982b565e945fc\">{\"x\":{\"tag\":{\"name\":\"Reactable\",\"attribs\":{\"data\":{\"dimension\":[\"economics\",\"economics\",\"economics\",\"economics\",\"economics\",\"economics\",\"economics\",\"economics\",\"economics\",\"economics\",\"economics\",\"economics\",\"economics\",\"economics\",\"economics\",\"economics\",\"economics\",\"economics\",\"economics\",\"economics\",\"economics\",\"economics\",\"economics\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environment\",\"environme